{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Batch-renders multi-language VO from a structured project folder (_Raw to _Processed) with per-language overrides and CSV logging. Requires SWS and ReaImGui.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Each track = one layer. The items on that track (left to right) = that layer's variations. Select the layer items (or just the layer tracks) and run.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Default mode: builds N variations side by side, every layer aligned in each slot. Variation 1 = file 1 of every layer, variation 2 = file 2, etc. Layers with fewer files cycle (or pick randomly, if chosen). A layer with one file is reused in every variation. Combo mode: builds every possible combination of layer files.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Alignment: item start (default) or first transient per item. Optional: one region per variation, ready for Render > Project regions. Fully undoable.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Measures LUFS and RMS for every file in the project's _Raw language folders and writes a CSV to Data. Requires SWS.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Measures LUFS, true peak and RMS of selected items without modifying the project. Prints to the console and optionally writes a CSV. Requires SWS.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Renames selected items to their region's name plus a two-digit counter (Region_01, Region_02...).\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Writes a text list of every plugin REAPER knows about, grouped by format, to the resource folder and opens it. Requires REAPER 6.37+.\par}
}
